WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 5]

02:07.760 --> 02:09.500
The cold poison is acting up more frequently now.

02:10.070 --> 02:11.820
I must get my hands on the Sunwarm Jade today.

02:20.880 --> 02:21.540
Who's there?

02:21.790 --> 02:22.540
Li.

02:24.150 --> 02:24.730
Who are you?

02:24.840 --> 02:25.540
It's me,

02:25.670 --> 02:26.410
Mo Caihuan.

02:52.760 --> 02:53.620
Open the door.

03:15.640 --> 03:16.490
Just you alone?

03:17.850 --> 03:19.290
You don't look well.

03:19.920 --> 03:21.100
Are you very sick?

03:21.870 --> 03:22.770
How did you find me?

03:23.950 --> 03:25.620
Anyone can see

03:26.070 --> 03:27.380
that tall guard of yours.

03:28.040 --> 03:28.900
What do you want?

03:31.070 --> 03:31.620
Here.

03:33.710 --> 03:34.690
Sunwarm Jade.

03:34.950 --> 03:36.290
Use it to cure yourself.

03:36.710 --> 03:37.540
Sunwarm Jade?

03:38.310 --> 03:39.380
Impossible.

03:40.070 --> 03:40.980
Don't worry.

03:41.590 --> 03:43.460
This is the real Sunwarm Jade.

03:44.120 --> 03:45.100
I won't cause you harm.

04:41.400 --> 04:42.340
Li!

04:59.680 --> 05:01.100
His poison runs deep.

06:45.560 --> 06:46.370
Li.

06:51.560 --> 06:52.340
Li.

06:52.600 --> 06:53.340
You're awake.

06:55.360 --> 06:56.220
Li.

07:08.360 --> 07:09.170
Look.

07:12.560 --> 07:14.020
It's truly a Sunwarm Jade.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.140
Did I fall asleep just now?

07:21.510 --> 07:22.140
Yes, you did.

07:35.430 --> 07:37.900
I let out your blood just now to cure you.

07:38.510 --> 07:39.810
It was all back at the start.

07:40.270 --> 07:42.140
But now, it's red like normal blood.

07:42.920 --> 07:44.850
You would still be unconscious, otherwise.

07:48.430 --> 07:49.020
Let me do it.

08:15.490 --> 08:16.240
How did you

08:17.390 --> 08:18.460
get the jade?

08:19.090 --> 08:20.460
They couldn't possibly let you have it.

08:22.870 --> 08:23.810
Actually,

08:24.560 --> 08:26.700
my mother and sister are good people.

08:27.310 --> 08:29.370
They are often threatened by bad guys,

08:29.920 --> 08:31.490
so they hope you can stay to protect them.

08:32.600 --> 08:34.490
They do not harbor malice.

08:35.630 --> 08:36.660
They just can't see

08:39.870 --> 08:40.810
that Jiayuan City

08:42.120 --> 08:43.410
isn't a place my father would stay in

08:44.630 --> 08:46.020
let alone you.

08:54.190 --> 08:55.170
Drink this now.

08:55.390 --> 08:56.580
It's Chinese ginseng broth.

09:04.950 --> 09:06.250
My father gave me the jade

09:06.680 --> 09:08.290
as my dowry.

09:09.190 --> 09:11.250
My sisters have their own dowries too.

09:12.430 --> 09:13.850
But I told my mother

09:14.190 --> 09:14.980
that I'd never

09:15.160 --> 09:15.850
marry anyone.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.100
Therefore, I have no use for it.

09:27.190 --> 09:28.170
And this one here.

09:28.920 --> 09:29.660
Thrombus Pill.

09:54.070 --> 09:54.930
You like to heal people?

09:57.630 --> 09:59.610
I've learned some from the books my father left behind.

10:01.360 --> 10:01.980
Your father

10:02.830 --> 10:03.810
was a great physician.

10:06.040 --> 10:06.930
Alas,

10:08.480 --> 10:09.610
he didn't want to be a physician.

10:10.630 --> 10:11.650
He wanted to be an immortal.

10:25.670 --> 10:26.530
Before this,

10:27.030 --> 10:28.060
I did not believe

10:28.390 --> 10:30.370
that the Sunwarm Jade was an excellent antidote.

10:31.150 --> 10:31.890
Me neither.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.180
Even though your father poisoned me,

10:35.750 --> 10:36.890
I trusted him when he told me

10:37.320 --> 10:38.220
that only the Sunwarm Jade

10:38.630 --> 10:39.220
could save me.

10:44.030 --> 10:44.530
No.

10:45.390 --> 10:46.180
He wasn't

10:46.360 --> 10:47.130
completely right.

10:49.000 --> 10:49.820
You saved me.

11:00.670 --> 11:01.610
Give me the jade.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.460
I mean

11:07.550 --> 11:09.060
I want to place it under the sun

11:09.670 --> 11:11.060
to see if its color can be restored.

11:14.630 --> 11:15.180
All right.

11:49.870 --> 11:50.530
Keep it.

11:50.720 --> 11:51.460
It's yours now.

12:02.910 --> 12:03.770
You should keep it.

12:14.240 --> 12:15.300
I

12:15.840 --> 12:17.010
have a favor to ask.

12:20.440 --> 12:20.980
Speak.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.300
Who do you want killed?

12:23.320 --> 12:23.940
It's not that.

12:24.150 --> 12:25.370
I...

12:27.440 --> 12:28.250
I want you

12:29.480 --> 12:31.060
to take me with you.

12:42.600 --> 12:43.650
Sorry, I can't do that.

13:01.270 --> 13:02.060
Okay.

13:47.200 --> 13:47.820
Why don't you

13:49.240 --> 13:50.370
stay with the Mo Family for now?

13:51.030 --> 13:52.010
If someone bothers them,

13:52.630 --> 13:53.820
you can protect them.

13:55.390 --> 13:56.490
Once I find a place to cultivate

13:56.960 --> 13:57.700
and settle down,

13:58.910 --> 13:59.610
I'll come and pick you up.

14:00.150 --> 14:00.980
What do you think?

14:25.740 --> 14:30.660
[Mo Residence]

14:30.660 --> 14:32.340
♪The ripples disappear into the river♪

14:32.980 --> 14:35.860
♪My robe is soaked under the drizzle♪

14:36.620 --> 14:40.700
♪I drink alone as the moonlight melts with the liquor♪

14:40.700 --> 14:42.060
[To Miss Mo]

14:42.340 --> 14:44.780
♪The current flows swiftly, the mountains weigh heavily♪

14:45.300 --> 14:47.500
♪The setting sun shines on the returning boats...♪

14:49.120 --> 14:49.700
Miss Mo,

14:50.480 --> 14:51.370
may this missive find you well.

14:52.200 --> 14:52.890
I have left.

14:54.960 --> 14:56.300
Qu Hun is a good friend of mine,

14:56.790 --> 14:58.300
and a great disciple of your father's.

14:59.440 --> 15:00.820
I entrust him to your hands.

15:01.550 --> 15:02.940
He should scare those

15:03.390 --> 15:04.370
who wish to give you trouble.

15:05.750 --> 15:06.490
Please keep

15:06.960 --> 15:07.650
the vial.

15:08.720 --> 15:09.490
Take care.

15:11.540 --> 15:13.660
♪The wind whispers to the forest♪

15:15.060 --> 15:19.620
♪I wander into the dream under the clear galaxy♪

15:23.260 --> 15:25.500
♪This journey that spans across the universe♪

15:26.100 --> 15:28.220
♪Feels both familiar and unfamiliar♪

15:29.340 --> 15:34.340
♪Looking at the various faces of our world♪

15:35.420 --> 15:37.340
♪Each word, each utterance♪

15:38.140 --> 15:40.140
♪Carries the hopes of a lifetime...♪

15:40.270 --> 15:41.100
Li!

15:41.780 --> 15:46.340
♪Let's make the present count and strive for a legacy♪

15:46.860 --> 15:49.020
♪Reunion and departure, searching around♪

15:49.860 --> 15:51.700
♪No one speaks the tongue I know♪

15:52.740 --> 15:57.740
♪Sadness follows me like a shadow♪

15:58.620 --> 16:00.620
♪I see the sky, the cloud, the moon, and the star♪

16:01.420 --> 16:03.300
♪I see the wind and the rain♪

16:05.100 --> 16:11.340
♪There's no need to ask when I will return♪

16:51.540 --> 16:55.380
[Nangong Wan, Core Formation Stage, Moonshadow Sect]

17:16.390 --> 17:17.130
Nichang.

17:19.550 --> 17:20.180
Wan.

17:20.960 --> 17:21.820
It's been 20 years.

17:22.080 --> 17:23.460
[Nichang, Leader of Moonshadow Sect]
You've finally left your cultivation.

17:29.000 --> 17:29.610
Nichang,

17:30.390 --> 17:31.940
what's new about the world?

17:33.320 --> 17:35.100
What else could it be?

17:36.080 --> 17:37.820
Just feuds

17:38.000 --> 17:39.100
and conflicts.

17:40.200 --> 17:41.820
Our grandmasters made the wise choice

17:42.670 --> 17:44.530
to forbid us from intervening

17:45.000 --> 17:45.980
in the mortal's affairs.

17:47.720 --> 17:48.340
Indeed.

17:48.550 --> 17:51.220
Some like to whine about how short life is.

17:52.080 --> 17:53.770
But if they are given the opportunity to live longer,

17:54.200 --> 17:54.850
who knows

17:54.870 --> 17:56.370
what matter of oddity they will commit?

17:56.960 --> 17:57.650
You know this

17:58.840 --> 18:00.060
better than all of us.

18:00.790 --> 18:02.700
So why did you leave the mountain to meddle in those affairs?

18:04.720 --> 18:05.650
Be it the demonic sects

18:06.200 --> 18:06.980
or the dark cultivators,

18:07.790 --> 18:09.060
they are endless.

18:09.910 --> 18:11.490
You should focus on your cultivation

18:12.360 --> 18:13.460
and ignore them.

18:15.240 --> 18:16.820
You sure are indifferent, Nichang.

18:17.960 --> 18:20.180
But I study the Maiden Cycle Technique.

18:20.360 --> 18:22.060
It requires me to be at peace.

18:22.480 --> 18:23.700
I hate strife

18:24.510 --> 18:25.250
so I must

18:25.440 --> 18:26.340
leave to intervene.

18:27.600 --> 18:28.700
You never listen to me.

18:29.080 --> 18:30.220
The mortal affairs are the most potent venom.

18:30.960 --> 18:32.180
Make sure you don't get too involved.

18:33.360 --> 18:34.980
Don't worry, Nichang.

18:36.120 --> 18:36.940
I'm planning

18:37.200 --> 18:38.820
to visit the six other sects first.

18:39.080 --> 18:39.980
Then,

18:40.590 --> 18:42.620
I'll check if they are dark cultivators and demonic sects roaming about.

18:42.750 --> 18:43.570
I'll be back soon.

18:44.550 --> 18:45.250
Do not forget

18:45.510 --> 18:47.290
that we are to host

18:48.720 --> 18:49.940
the next Immortal Ascension Trials.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.220
Worry not, Nichang.

18:57.790 --> 18:58.620
Cultivators

18:59.310 --> 19:01.180
[Tainan Valley]
rarely appear in crowded places.

19:02.270 --> 19:03.530
Where do they usually go?

19:05.110 --> 19:06.860
Are there truly cultivators in Tainan Valley?

19:08.830 --> 19:09.730
I want to see

19:10.400 --> 19:11.770
what they see.

19:14.000 --> 19:15.940
The valley a hundred li south of Jiayuan City

19:17.200 --> 19:18.660
is shrouded by mists all year round.

19:20.920 --> 19:22.220
According to the scroll, Tainan Valley

19:23.070 --> 19:24.140
should be here.

19:39.380 --> 19:42.420
[Wan Xiaoshan]

19:48.270 --> 19:49.090
I am Wan Xiaoshan.

19:49.310 --> 19:50.220
How may I address you?

19:53.070 --> 19:53.570
Han Li.

19:54.600 --> 19:55.530
Your name is Han Li, I see.

19:56.290 --> 19:57.490
You're alone here.

19:58.110 --> 20:00.140
You must be a rogue cultivator who wishes to enter Tainan Valley.

20:00.510 --> 20:01.050
You know what?

20:01.440 --> 20:02.220
Let's band up.

20:03.160 --> 20:03.700
Band up?

20:06.270 --> 20:07.460
Are you perhaps lost?

20:07.960 --> 20:08.980
Han,

20:09.510 --> 20:10.530
don't underestimate me.

20:10.790 --> 20:11.380
Even though

20:11.510 --> 20:12.420
I'm an elementary cultivator,

20:12.750 --> 20:14.420
I know very well

20:14.750 --> 20:15.980
how to get to Tainan Valley.

20:19.070 --> 20:19.660
All right, then.

20:20.240 --> 20:20.770
Let's travel together.

20:21.270 --> 20:21.730
Lead the way.

20:22.310 --> 20:22.770
Follow me.

20:28.160 --> 20:29.530
What do you mean by a rogue cultivator?

20:30.350 --> 20:31.530
Like us,

20:32.000 --> 20:34.420
we do not belong to those seven sects like Moonshadow Sect

20:34.590 --> 20:36.490
or hail from a cultivator clan like the Yans.

20:36.680 --> 20:37.620
We cultivate alone

20:37.750 --> 20:38.730
so we are the rogue cultivators.

20:42.880 --> 20:43.420
He seems

20:43.590 --> 20:45.660
to know quite a lot about cultivation.

20:46.400 --> 20:47.660
Perhaps I can get more out of him.

20:52.030 --> 20:52.570
Wan,

20:53.750 --> 20:54.730
do you know of a way

20:55.070 --> 20:56.460
to dispel the mist before us?

20:57.750 --> 20:58.660
Han,

20:58.720 --> 21:00.220
you must have only become a cultivator recently.

21:01.110 --> 21:02.220
This misty barrier

21:02.240 --> 21:03.770
only opens up once every 10 years.

21:04.200 --> 21:04.860
If we can't enter the valley,

21:05.440 --> 21:06.700
it means it is not the right moment yet.

21:08.030 --> 21:08.530
Come.

21:09.160 --> 21:09.770
Have some fruit.

21:13.880 --> 21:15.090
They say

21:15.440 --> 21:16.980
immortals do not eat rice.

21:18.000 --> 21:19.770
They ingest wind and pebbles and drink morning dew.

21:20.590 --> 21:21.940
That's not true then.

21:25.440 --> 21:26.220
Only immortals

21:26.590 --> 21:27.620
do that.

21:28.160 --> 21:29.250
People like us

21:29.310 --> 21:30.420
are called cultivators.

21:30.920 --> 21:31.700
Immortals

21:31.720 --> 21:33.620
live as long as the universe.

21:35.270 --> 21:36.770
They live as long as the universe?

21:37.400 --> 21:39.380
No wonder Physician Mo did everything to become one.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.420
But considering our current cultivation progress,

21:41.680 --> 21:42.940
we can only live a century at most.

21:45.030 --> 21:45.900
That's not bad already.

21:48.030 --> 21:48.810
It's open!

21:54.310 --> 21:55.090
Wan.

21:57.240 --> 21:57.810
Wan?

21:58.440 --> 21:59.010
Come in.

22:01.600 --> 22:02.550
Check this out.

22:02.550 --> 22:04.180
Check out this Glacial Sword.

22:04.310 --> 22:05.860
- Check out this Glacial Sword. - Advanced Ice Talisman.

22:05.960 --> 22:07.460
Three gems for one talisman.

22:07.480 --> 22:08.570
Check this out.

22:09.110 --> 22:09.730
Wan,

22:10.110 --> 22:10.660
this is...

22:11.110 --> 22:12.460
This is Tainan Bazaar.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.700
It

22:13.740 --> 22:14.700
lasts for three days.

22:14.880 --> 22:15.490
We're lucky

22:15.590 --> 22:16.420
to run into its opening.

22:16.790 --> 22:18.460
This is a fair price already.

22:21.030 --> 22:21.730
20 gems.

22:21.750 --> 22:22.900
Come. Take a look.

22:24.680 --> 22:25.460
Come.

22:25.590 --> 22:27.220
A century-old ironcoil snake.

22:27.590 --> 22:29.330
It took me a lot to catch it.

22:29.350 --> 22:30.660
Glacial Sword!

22:30.680 --> 22:32.220
Check out my Glacial Sword.

22:32.510 --> 22:34.090
20 gems for one.

22:34.110 --> 22:35.050
Talisman.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.010
Do you want any?

22:36.030 --> 22:36.530
Take a look.

22:36.550 --> 22:37.380
- Come. - Come take a look.

22:39.030 --> 22:40.140
My friend,

22:40.160 --> 22:41.490
come browse my wares.

22:41.550 --> 22:42.700
- Come. - Advanced Ice...

22:43.270 --> 22:44.940
Advanced Ice Talisman for three gems only.

22:46.440 --> 22:47.940
Common items like these aren't very useful.

22:48.310 --> 22:49.090
They are common?

22:54.160 --> 22:56.250
You need gems to buy them. Do you have any?

22:56.550 --> 22:57.490
Besides,

22:57.720 --> 22:58.900
it's a rip-off.

23:00.110 --> 23:00.900
Are gems

23:01.830 --> 23:03.180
the currency

23:03.350 --> 23:04.180
among cultivators?

23:05.920 --> 23:06.660
Come on, Han.

23:11.000 --> 23:11.810
As the name

23:11.830 --> 23:12.660
suggests,

23:12.680 --> 23:14.330
a gem is a stone filled with spiritual aura.

23:17.240 --> 23:18.220
A good gem

23:18.240 --> 23:19.090
is transparent and bright.

23:19.270 --> 23:20.900
You can use it as a source of light.

23:23.480 --> 23:25.140
This is already a very fair price.

23:25.920 --> 23:27.570
Mine is not as good,

23:27.920 --> 23:28.660
but it's

23:28.830 --> 23:29.900
good enough to provide energy

23:30.160 --> 23:31.980
for an array or to restore your spiritual power

23:32.160 --> 23:32.810
after a battle.

23:59.200 --> 24:00.090
Another rogue cultivator.

24:01.070 --> 24:01.770
How many has it been?

24:02.510 --> 24:03.250
Grandmaster,

24:03.640 --> 24:04.290
this is the seventh.

24:06.400 --> 24:06.980
Grandmaster,

24:07.920 --> 24:09.180
I found this nearby.

24:09.720 --> 24:10.120
Yan?

24:10.120 --> 24:10.920
[Qing, Yu]

24:10.920 --> 24:11.900
From the Yan Clan Stronghold?

24:11.940 --> 24:12.640
[Yan]

24:12.640 --> 24:13.770
Those clan disciples

24:14.270 --> 24:15.900
love to bully rogue cultivators.

24:16.030 --> 24:16.620
Enough.

24:17.440 --> 24:18.860
Do not jump to conclusions before we investigate thoroughly.

24:19.400 --> 24:20.010
Yes.

24:20.960 --> 24:21.940
The barrier has been lifted.

24:22.440 --> 24:23.290
The valley

24:23.310 --> 24:24.700
is now filled with rogue and clan

24:24.830 --> 24:25.700
disciples.

24:26.160 --> 24:27.140
Both parties are not on good terms

24:27.270 --> 24:28.460
so anything could happen.

24:30.550 --> 24:31.490
Yu, Qing.

24:32.110 --> 24:33.220
Dispatch more disciples

24:33.440 --> 24:34.730
to guard the valley.

24:35.270 --> 24:36.530
I don't want any accidents

24:36.680 --> 24:37.980
before the Immortal Ascension Trials.

24:39.240 --> 24:39.860
Understood.

24:50.440 --> 24:51.220
Keen eyes, Miss.

24:51.480 --> 24:53.220
The emerald stones embedded on the bracelet

24:53.400 --> 24:53.940
come from

24:54.070 --> 24:55.570
[Yan Ruyan]
the eyes of a Grade 2 Twinhead Raven.

24:56.070 --> 24:56.460
Well,

24:56.640 --> 24:57.330
it's a bit

24:57.440 --> 24:57.940
expensive.

24:58.270 --> 24:59.050
500 gems.

24:59.350 --> 25:00.010
500?

25:00.510 --> 25:01.620
You might as well commit robbery.

25:01.830 --> 25:02.900
- Do you know we are... - Enough.

25:03.510 --> 25:04.530
Scarcity brings up the price.

25:05.480 --> 25:06.460
Father will like this.

25:12.510 --> 25:13.700
Miss, this is...

25:14.200 --> 25:15.010
Take it.

25:15.920 --> 25:16.700
Thank you, Miss.

25:17.590 --> 25:18.090
I...

25:19.270 --> 25:20.330
Thank the maker!

25:24.960 --> 25:25.420
Stay there.

25:26.480 --> 25:27.660
They are the ones who killed Liu.

25:28.790 --> 25:29.530
Nonsense.

25:33.480 --> 25:34.090
Foundation Establishment Stage?

25:34.270 --> 25:36.980
A Foundation Establishment Stage cultivator is her guard.

25:38.070 --> 25:39.490
Just who exactly is that woman?

25:39.790 --> 25:40.490
Feng,

25:40.750 --> 25:41.570
who said you could intervene?

25:43.110 --> 25:44.010
[Feng]
Forgive me, Miss Yan.

25:44.790 --> 25:45.330
Your safety

25:45.510 --> 25:46.660
dictates the continuity of Yan Clan Stronghold.

25:46.960 --> 25:47.730
Master has instructed me

25:47.960 --> 25:48.980
to prioritize your safety.

25:49.270 --> 25:50.460
She's Yan Ruyan?

25:51.720 --> 25:52.860
Yan Ruyan?

25:53.070 --> 25:54.250
Is her family very famous?

25:54.680 --> 25:55.860
Of course!

25:56.680 --> 25:59.330
Her family is the top cultivation family in the Yue Kingdom.

25:59.480 --> 26:00.810
The paterfamilias, Yan Yunshan,

26:01.750 --> 26:03.180
is her father.

26:03.590 --> 26:05.090
He's a cultivator in the Core Formation Stage.

26:09.640 --> 26:10.140
Wan,

26:10.270 --> 26:11.290
you know many things.

26:12.070 --> 26:12.810
I'm so impressed.

26:15.750 --> 26:17.220
He is so knowledgeable.

26:17.880 --> 26:18.860
I should listen to him more.

26:21.200 --> 26:22.140
Look.

26:22.590 --> 26:24.250
I know everything about the cultivation world

26:24.480 --> 26:26.050
in the Yue Kingdom.

26:26.680 --> 26:28.380
Just ask me anything if you have questions.

26:29.680 --> 26:30.140
Thank you,

26:30.310 --> 26:30.860
Wan.

26:31.510 --> 26:32.460
Just call me Xiaoshan.

26:33.750 --> 26:34.380
Xiaoshan.

26:41.030 --> 26:41.940
By the authority of the seven sects,

26:42.960 --> 26:44.050
all troublemakers

26:44.400 --> 26:46.180
will be disqualified from the trials

26:47.070 --> 26:48.380
and expelled from Tainan Valley.

26:48.830 --> 26:49.980
As this is your first offense,

26:50.680 --> 26:51.420
I'll forgive you but don't do it again.

26:51.920 --> 26:52.570
Leave right now.

26:54.750 --> 26:56.140
She's holding the token

26:56.750 --> 26:59.860
of a Core Formation Stage cultivator from the Moonshadow Sect.

27:04.270 --> 27:05.140
Miss Ruyan,

27:05.440 --> 27:06.810
Grandmaster Nangong would like to see you.

27:07.240 --> 27:08.090
What is the meaning of this?

27:08.350 --> 27:09.090
Grandmaster Nangong?

27:09.110 --> 27:10.490
Is your sect challenging Yan Clan Stronghold

27:10.830 --> 27:12.770
for a few rogue cultivators?

27:12.920 --> 27:14.010
Cease your impertinence, Feng.

27:14.790 --> 27:15.570
Withdraw for now.

27:15.680 --> 27:16.490
I will be back in a moment.

27:25.240 --> 27:25.730
Han,

27:26.000 --> 27:26.530
come.

27:34.830 --> 27:36.570
What a day.

27:37.030 --> 27:39.010
I saw a Foundation Establishment Stage cultivator serving as a guard

27:39.310 --> 27:41.380
and also a token from a Core Formation Stage cultivator.

27:44.350 --> 27:44.980
There is always

27:45.160 --> 27:46.570
someone more powerful than the powerful ones.

27:47.790 --> 27:48.770
If you see them

27:49.000 --> 27:50.730
in the future, Han,

27:51.030 --> 27:52.860
you run away.

27:56.510 --> 27:57.050
Run away?

27:58.640 --> 27:59.050
Let's go.

27:59.400 --> 28:00.220
I'll show you around.

28:03.440 --> 28:04.010
Thank you so much,

28:04.200 --> 28:05.460
Xiaoshan.

28:05.680 --> 28:06.420
No worries at all.

28:06.750 --> 28:08.530
Rogue cultivators are like my brothers.

28:09.070 --> 28:10.220
If you have further...

28:11.830 --> 28:12.770
Are you all right?

28:13.070 --> 28:13.900
Are you all right?

28:14.030 --> 28:14.570
I'm fine.

28:14.700 --> 28:15.380
Thank you.

28:15.460 --> 28:16.180
Look where you're going.

28:16.270 --> 28:16.660
Okay.

28:19.790 --> 28:21.570
You sure are stealthy, my friend.

28:22.550 --> 28:23.010
But

28:23.790 --> 28:24.570
[Daoist Qingwen]
I suggest

28:24.590 --> 28:25.860
you return the pouch to its owner.

28:28.960 --> 28:29.900
[Hu Pinggu]
Didn't you promise

28:30.070 --> 28:30.770
to stop stealing?

28:33.260 --> 28:34.900
[Wu Jiuzhi]

28:37.000 --> 28:37.530
Xiaoshan,

28:38.350 --> 28:39.980
it seems like we have thieves among the cultivators too.

28:41.200 --> 28:42.460
He took your pouch first.

28:43.030 --> 28:44.050
I merely grabbed some interest on your behalf.

28:44.550 --> 28:45.140
Isn't it fair?

28:46.220 --> 28:46.770
You...

28:46.830 --> 28:47.380
I

28:47.480 --> 28:48.570
just wanted to borrow it.

28:49.110 --> 28:50.250
I didn't say I wouldn't return it.

28:52.350 --> 28:52.860
Give it back.

28:57.440 --> 28:57.980
Give it back.

28:58.830 --> 28:59.330
Give it back!

28:59.960 --> 29:01.330
He took my things and won't give them back.

29:02.590 --> 29:03.010
You two

29:03.310 --> 29:04.810
should check if your personal effects are intact.

29:05.110 --> 29:05.570
That's right.

29:06.070 --> 29:08.090
This happens on the Azure Vein Society's territory.

29:08.400 --> 29:09.140
Our leader

29:09.310 --> 29:10.620
will intervene.

29:11.310 --> 29:12.530
You belong to the Azure Vein Society?

29:13.030 --> 29:13.980
Qingwen is my Dharma name.

29:14.550 --> 29:15.980
This is my peer, Hu Pinggu.

29:16.440 --> 29:16.980
My friend,

29:17.200 --> 29:18.220
since you've heard of my society,

29:18.590 --> 29:19.860
will you be so kind

29:20.240 --> 29:22.050
as to look past what the thief did?

29:26.070 --> 29:27.570
It feels like you're reciting lines.

29:28.160 --> 29:29.490
Is this perhaps a premeditated ruse?

29:30.240 --> 29:30.810
Han,

29:31.510 --> 29:32.940
Daoist Qingwen is known for his heroic deeds

29:33.070 --> 29:34.700
among the rogue cultivators.

29:35.310 --> 29:37.330
We have not suffered any losses.

29:37.550 --> 29:38.860
Let's just move on.

29:39.510 --> 29:39.980
Everything's fine.

29:40.110 --> 29:40.460
Everything's fine.

29:40.750 --> 29:41.290
Let's go, Han.

29:43.310 --> 29:44.140
Give back the pouch.

29:48.270 --> 29:49.050
Thank you.

29:49.400 --> 29:49.860
My friends,

29:50.920 --> 29:52.330
Wu Jiuzhi is mischievous,

29:52.750 --> 29:53.570
but he bears no ill intention.

29:54.880 --> 29:55.490
If he did offend you,

29:55.750 --> 29:56.220
I

29:56.790 --> 29:57.330
apologize

29:57.480 --> 29:58.140
on his behalf.

29:58.440 --> 29:58.860
That's right.

29:59.400 --> 30:00.090
- We crossed paths today. - These two

30:00.110 --> 30:00.900
are either crooks...

30:00.920 --> 30:01.620
How may I...

30:01.640 --> 30:02.730
- or fraudsters. - address you two?

30:02.960 --> 30:03.860
I should stay away from them.

30:03.880 --> 30:04.570
You're too courteous, sir.

30:05.160 --> 30:06.250
I am Wan Xiaoshan.

30:06.480 --> 30:07.700
This is my friend, Han Li.

30:08.750 --> 30:09.810
And he exposed my name just like that.

30:13.110 --> 30:14.140
You look like

30:14.160 --> 30:15.900
you're here for the trials.

30:16.200 --> 30:16.900
Our society

30:16.920 --> 30:18.380
has rented a venue nearby

30:18.510 --> 30:20.010
to discuss the trials

30:20.030 --> 30:21.220
with other rogue cultivators.

30:21.830 --> 30:23.380
Would you like

30:23.640 --> 30:24.490
to join us?

30:24.640 --> 30:25.380
Of course.

30:27.720 --> 30:28.420
Grandmaster,

30:29.160 --> 30:30.940
Miss Ruyan from the Yan Clan Stronghold is here.

30:37.310 --> 30:38.700
I'm Yan Ruyan of the Yan Clan Stronghold.

30:38.880 --> 30:40.250
Greetings, Grandmaster Nangong.

30:42.590 --> 30:44.050
I was told you brought a lot of guards

30:44.480 --> 30:45.570
to Tainan with you.

30:47.110 --> 30:47.980
Grandmaster Nangong,

30:48.720 --> 30:50.420
while I can't speak for other prestigious families,

30:50.880 --> 30:51.900
I can reassure you

30:52.440 --> 30:53.620
that my guards have never left my side

30:53.640 --> 30:56.050
ever since I set foot in Tainan.

30:56.400 --> 30:58.010
My family has nothing to do

30:58.110 --> 30:59.730
with the disappearance of rogue cultivators.

31:01.510 --> 31:02.980
You keep yourself abreast with the goings-on.

31:03.680 --> 31:05.090
But how do you explain this?

31:05.220 --> 31:06.780
[Yan]

31:07.400 --> 31:08.090
We found this

31:08.110 --> 31:09.980
next to a dead rogue cultivator.

31:10.960 --> 31:11.460
Grandmaster Nangong,

31:11.920 --> 31:12.860
a female attendant of mine

31:12.880 --> 31:14.420
had her token stolen

31:14.510 --> 31:15.810
since we entered Tainan.

31:16.200 --> 31:17.730
Someone is obviously trying to frame me.

31:27.480 --> 31:28.860
Have you decided on which sect to join?

31:29.720 --> 31:31.700
Grandfather recommended Spirit Beast Mountain many times.

31:32.110 --> 31:33.660
But I prefer the Moonshadow Sect.

31:34.400 --> 31:35.810
You have better taste than your grandfather.

31:38.000 --> 31:39.050
All right. You may return.

31:39.310 --> 31:40.940
Be prepared for the trials tomorrow.

31:44.920 --> 31:45.530
Grandmaster,

31:46.270 --> 31:48.010
judging from those brash rogue cultivators just now,

31:48.790 --> 31:50.330
they were clearly manipulated by someone else.

31:50.920 --> 31:51.860
Yet Yan Clan Stronghold

31:52.000 --> 31:53.180
does not make enemies often.

31:53.350 --> 31:54.220
Do you know

31:54.750 --> 31:56.180
who is trying to frame us?

31:57.790 --> 31:58.570
In my opinion,

31:59.640 --> 32:01.290
Yan Clan Stronghold is not the only target.

32:01.880 --> 32:03.180
Your behavior

32:03.590 --> 32:04.810
does not merely represent your family,

32:05.640 --> 32:07.050
but also other clan disciples

32:07.200 --> 32:08.140
like you.

32:08.590 --> 32:10.620
Someone is trying to exacerbate the divide

32:10.830 --> 32:12.220
between the clan disciples and rogue cultivators.

32:17.030 --> 32:18.010
I shall take my leave.

32:31.200 --> 32:31.770
Grandmaster.

32:32.110 --> 32:33.770
I can't let Spirit Beast Mountain

32:34.240 --> 32:36.010
take away a smart girl like her.

32:37.830 --> 32:38.250
My friends,

32:38.960 --> 32:40.940
this is our base.

32:42.200 --> 32:43.290
Welcome aboard!

32:44.070 --> 32:46.050
We are a family of rogue cultivators.

32:46.480 --> 32:47.460
Welcome!

32:48.830 --> 32:49.570
Welcome!

32:49.680 --> 32:50.660
Welcome.

32:50.750 --> 32:51.330
Welcome.

32:51.350 --> 32:52.620
- Welcome. - Welcome.

32:52.760 --> 32:53.730
Welcome.

32:54.280 --> 32:55.960
- Thank you, sir. - Thank you, sir.

32:58.180 --> 32:59.220
[Map]

32:59.830 --> 33:00.980
This is a map of the Yue Kingdom.

33:01.160 --> 33:02.940
I chanced upon this map

33:03.750 --> 33:04.530
and found it intriguing.

33:05.160 --> 33:06.220
You can find

33:06.440 --> 33:07.490
all seven sects on it.

33:08.200 --> 33:08.940
That's the Moonshadow Sect.

33:08.960 --> 33:09.660
That's the Spirit Beast Mountain.

33:09.680 --> 33:10.530
That's the Saber-Shearing Sect.

33:10.550 --> 33:11.330
That's the Clear Void Sect.

33:11.350 --> 33:11.980
Skyfort Castle.

33:12.000 --> 33:13.050
That's the Yellow Maple Valley.

33:13.440 --> 33:14.570
That's the Giant Sword Sect.

33:14.920 --> 33:16.380
These seven cultivating sects

33:16.510 --> 33:17.660
are generally abbreviated as the seven sects.

33:18.030 --> 33:19.180
They survived a fierce battle

33:19.200 --> 33:20.050
1,000 years ago

33:20.070 --> 33:20.980
in the Yue Kingdom.

33:21.440 --> 33:21.860
Then,

33:22.160 --> 33:23.180
where is Yan Clan Stronghold?

33:24.110 --> 33:25.090
Yan Clan Stronghold.

33:25.200 --> 33:25.700
Here.

33:25.960 --> 33:26.700
[Yan Clan Stronghold]
That's the Yan Clan Stronghold.

33:26.720 --> 33:27.180
- Yes. - That's right.

33:27.200 --> 33:27.660
There.

33:27.880 --> 33:28.220
Yes.

33:28.240 --> 33:28.620
There.

33:28.750 --> 33:29.330
Then,

33:30.030 --> 33:31.140
where do rogue cultivators belong?

33:31.400 --> 33:32.620
We...

33:35.750 --> 33:37.010
We're not on this map.

33:38.030 --> 33:39.050
I might even say

33:39.550 --> 33:41.220
that we won't have a place in the Yue Kingdom either.

33:41.400 --> 33:42.140
Enough, Qingwen.

33:42.350 --> 33:43.180
We brought them here

33:43.310 --> 33:44.980
to discuss the trials.

33:45.310 --> 33:46.330
Why bring this up?

33:47.920 --> 33:48.700
I'm sorry.

33:49.160 --> 33:50.810
Some rogue cultivators have gone missing lately.

33:51.590 --> 33:52.900
Some are also left stranded...

33:52.920 --> 33:53.620
Qingwen.

33:54.880 --> 33:55.940
What are they trying to achieve?

33:57.000 --> 33:57.940
They never finish their sentence,

33:58.510 --> 33:59.380
and that only diverts more attention to them.

34:00.030 --> 34:00.900
We're cultivating as well.

34:01.240 --> 34:02.570
How come some were born

34:02.920 --> 34:04.380
with access to so many resources,

34:05.640 --> 34:06.420
while we

34:06.590 --> 34:07.530
have to risk our lives

34:08.350 --> 34:09.420
for a Foundation Pill?

34:10.000 --> 34:10.460
Exactly.

34:10.550 --> 34:11.220
That's unfair.

34:11.400 --> 34:12.180
A Foundation Pill?

34:14.480 --> 34:15.570
What is that?

34:16.240 --> 34:17.620
You cannot not know this.

34:17.880 --> 34:18.530
A Foundation Pill

34:18.590 --> 34:20.730
can help a cultivator to get to the Foundation Establishment Stage

34:20.750 --> 34:22.810
from the Qi Refining Stage.

34:23.550 --> 34:24.220
Qi Refining Stage?

34:26.790 --> 34:27.860
Which stage am I in?

34:28.510 --> 34:29.940
If you're just starting out,

34:30.030 --> 34:31.180
you're in the Qi Refining Stage.

34:36.000 --> 34:36.490
And then?

34:37.160 --> 34:38.420
Listen carefully.

34:38.750 --> 34:39.810
In the world of cultivation,

34:39.960 --> 34:41.380
all stages can be divided into

34:41.480 --> 34:43.290
lower level, middle level,

34:43.400 --> 34:44.220
and upper level.

34:44.880 --> 34:46.290
The lower level stages include

34:46.400 --> 34:47.570
the Qi Refining Stage,

34:47.750 --> 34:48.330
the Foundation Establishment Stage,

34:48.480 --> 34:49.090
the Core Formation Stage,

34:49.200 --> 34:49.810
the Nascent Soul Stage,

34:49.920 --> 34:50.900
and the Spirit Transformation Stage.

34:51.200 --> 34:52.050
The middle level stages

34:52.160 --> 34:52.730
are

34:53.400 --> 34:53.980
the Void Refining Stage,

34:54.270 --> 34:54.860
the Body Unity Stage,

34:55.000 --> 34:55.860
and the Great Ascension Stage.

34:56.310 --> 34:57.140
The upper level stage

34:57.350 --> 34:58.220
only has

34:58.400 --> 34:59.570
the Tribulation Transcendence Stage.

35:00.000 --> 35:00.770
If you ascend from this stage,

35:00.920 --> 35:01.420
you can

35:01.550 --> 35:02.420
become an immortal

35:02.510 --> 35:03.380
and live as long as the universe.

35:05.030 --> 35:06.090
But these are just myths.

35:06.480 --> 35:07.730
No one has seen anyone above

35:07.790 --> 35:08.770
the Nascent Soul Stage.

35:10.830 --> 35:11.730
Is it very difficult

35:12.920 --> 35:13.770
to get a Foundation Pill?

35:15.240 --> 35:16.620
It's not just difficult to get one.

35:17.350 --> 35:18.250
The pill

35:18.400 --> 35:20.250
determines the fate of a cultivator,

35:20.790 --> 35:21.530
and by extension,

35:21.640 --> 35:23.490
the future of a sect.

35:24.720 --> 35:25.420
Therefore,

35:25.640 --> 35:26.770
in the past, the seven sects

35:26.960 --> 35:28.180
and the prestigious families

35:28.270 --> 35:29.530
had a monopoly over the pills.

35:31.000 --> 35:32.140
They have all the pills.

35:34.240 --> 35:35.980
Until the trials came along.

35:37.590 --> 35:38.290
Han,

35:39.070 --> 35:40.770
at a glance, the trials

35:40.880 --> 35:41.770
give you a chance

35:41.830 --> 35:43.570
to enter the seven sects.

35:44.110 --> 35:44.820
But in reality,

35:44.920 --> 35:46.570
everyone is after the pills.

35:48.400 --> 35:49.260
500 years ago,

35:49.550 --> 35:50.650
a veteran rogue cultivator

35:50.920 --> 35:52.380
gathered thousands of other rogue cultivators

35:52.510 --> 35:53.740
to negotiate with the seven sects.

35:54.280 --> 35:55.610
Thanks to them, we now have a chance to compete fairly

35:56.230 --> 35:57.490
against disciples of prestigious clans

35:57.550 --> 35:59.300
to enter the seven sects.

36:00.150 --> 36:00.860
And as a result,

36:00.920 --> 36:02.010
we also become their enemies.

36:02.920 --> 36:03.530
But let's be frank.

36:04.070 --> 36:06.010
We rogue cultivators do not have access to many things.

36:06.150 --> 36:07.210
And those who hail from a prestigious clan

36:07.320 --> 36:08.860
can feed their disciples with tons of elixirs.

36:09.550 --> 36:10.210
How is this fair?

36:10.230 --> 36:11.650
Yes, that's not fair.

36:11.800 --> 36:13.090
Uneven distribution of resources.

36:13.840 --> 36:14.530
No wonder

36:15.030 --> 36:15.820
they hate

36:15.880 --> 36:16.860
the clan disciples.

36:18.800 --> 36:20.460
Have you found anything about the rogue cultivators?

36:21.000 --> 36:22.050
Several men are following

36:22.150 --> 36:23.460
the core members as we speak.

36:23.960 --> 36:25.460
The leader is a man called Qingwen.

36:26.110 --> 36:28.130
He has only attained Tier 11 of the Qi Refining Stage,

36:28.440 --> 36:30.170
but he is a great speaker.

36:30.510 --> 36:31.650
He has many followers

36:31.840 --> 36:33.300
among the rogue cultivators.

36:33.630 --> 36:34.380
Keep a close eye on him.

36:35.000 --> 36:36.170
Let me know

36:36.320 --> 36:37.300
if anything happens.

36:37.590 --> 36:38.010
Yes.

36:41.480 --> 36:41.860
My friends,

36:43.070 --> 36:44.900
the seven sects will put us through two trials.

36:45.070 --> 36:45.490
The first one

36:45.760 --> 36:46.980
is the spirit root trial tomorrow.

36:47.400 --> 36:47.820
The second one

36:48.110 --> 36:49.860
is the Tianwu Arena trial tomorrow.

36:50.880 --> 36:51.980
The Tianwu Arena trial

36:52.110 --> 36:52.940
is very dangerous.

36:53.360 --> 36:53.900
Therefore,

36:54.190 --> 36:56.010
we must secure a spot

36:56.320 --> 36:57.170
in tomorrow's trial first.

36:58.230 --> 36:59.170
A spirit root

36:59.400 --> 36:59.860
comes in

36:59.960 --> 37:01.340
five elements: metal, wood, water,

37:01.510 --> 37:02.210
fire, and earth.

37:02.670 --> 37:03.170
You know it already.

37:03.190 --> 37:05.050
- Metal, wood, water, fire, and earth. - Mortals do not have a spirit root

37:05.070 --> 37:06.170
so they cannot cultivate.

37:06.800 --> 37:07.780
The more spirit roots you have,

37:07.880 --> 37:09.380
the worse you progress.

37:10.320 --> 37:12.740
Those who have four or five spirit root elements

37:13.360 --> 37:16.050
can sense the spiritual aura around us.

37:16.710 --> 37:18.090
Yet they can only reach

37:18.320 --> 37:20.380
Tier 3 or Tier 4 in their lives at most.

37:21.230 --> 37:22.130
We call this

37:22.400 --> 37:23.490
a fake spirit root.

37:23.630 --> 37:24.900
- Fake spirit root? - Fake spirit root?

37:25.400 --> 37:27.420
Those who have two or three spirit root elements

37:28.000 --> 37:28.900
have

37:29.320 --> 37:30.090
a true spirit root.

37:31.070 --> 37:31.650
Sir,

37:31.960 --> 37:33.380
what if the spirit root comes with only one element?

37:33.960 --> 37:35.650
Then, it is an exceptionally rare heavenly spirit root

37:36.550 --> 37:37.650
A cultivator with that gift

37:37.840 --> 37:38.940
has earned the favor of the maker.

37:39.920 --> 37:40.860
His progress

37:41.070 --> 37:41.860
will defy comprehension.

37:43.760 --> 37:46.090
I see. Cultivation is deeply tied to one's talent.

37:47.400 --> 37:48.690
In that case, do I have a true spirit root

37:49.110 --> 37:49.980
or a fake spirit root?

37:51.280 --> 37:52.460
Physician Mo never told me.

37:57.150 --> 37:58.420
I hope I have the heavenly spirit root.

37:59.590 --> 38:01.090
There are only limited spots

38:01.230 --> 38:02.380
for those who wish to enroll in the seven sects

38:02.400 --> 38:03.170
through the spirit root trial.

38:04.030 --> 38:05.420
People from the prestigious clan

38:05.630 --> 38:07.340
will do what they can to take our spots

38:07.880 --> 38:09.420
in the seven sects.

38:09.670 --> 38:10.940
They wish to impede our cultivation.

38:15.800 --> 38:17.130
So, power speaks the loudest

38:17.590 --> 38:19.090
in the cultivation world.

38:23.440 --> 38:24.650
Tier 1 to Tier 13.

38:26.230 --> 38:27.610
It is the complete set of Longevity Art.

38:32.150 --> 38:32.610
Interested?

38:34.840 --> 38:35.420
Pay up.

38:36.110 --> 38:36.490
How much?

38:37.070 --> 38:37.690
Nine gems.

38:37.690 --> 38:38.220
[Meng Wu]

38:39.030 --> 38:39.860
Nine gems?

38:40.230 --> 38:40.820
That's too expensive.

38:43.590 --> 38:44.900
Tier 10 of the Qi Refining Stage?

38:45.550 --> 38:46.570
Now you've seen what I can do.

38:47.030 --> 38:47.900
Pay up.

38:52.710 --> 38:53.380
Little girl,

38:53.840 --> 38:54.740
I do want to buy

38:54.920 --> 38:55.900
this book.

38:56.280 --> 38:57.780
But nine gems is too expensive.

38:58.280 --> 38:59.210
Can I ask for a better price?

38:59.670 --> 39:00.420
How much are you offering?

39:02.030 --> 39:02.860
Two?

39:05.400 --> 39:06.090
Da.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.010
Er.

39:07.230 --> 39:07.980
San.

39:08.110 --> 39:08.650
Si.

39:08.840 --> 39:09.860
Come!

39:11.440 --> 39:12.210
Is this the guy?

39:12.760 --> 39:13.340
That's right.

39:14.550 --> 39:15.490
He read our book

39:15.760 --> 39:16.650
but refused to pay.

39:17.030 --> 39:17.900
I'm selling it for nine gems.

39:18.110 --> 39:19.340
But he only offered two.

39:19.500 --> 39:20.500
[Meng Da, Meng Si]

39:21.070 --> 39:22.460
What in the daylight robbery!

39:22.460 --> 39:22.940
[Meng San, Meng Er]

39:23.480 --> 39:23.980
What?

39:24.280 --> 39:25.820
How did you know we were robbers

39:25.880 --> 39:26.780
before we started cultivating?

39:26.800 --> 39:28.050
- How did you know? - How did you know?

39:28.150 --> 39:29.740
We quit many years ago.

39:29.880 --> 39:30.740
How did you know?

39:30.880 --> 39:32.210
Speak up.

39:33.000 --> 39:33.820
Everyone,

39:34.480 --> 39:35.980
this sign means two

39:36.280 --> 39:38.530
strengthening pills

39:38.840 --> 39:39.940
for your book.

39:40.510 --> 39:41.010
What do you think?

39:52.000 --> 39:52.420
Give me

39:52.480 --> 39:52.980
the book.

40:05.030 --> 40:05.490
Stand there.

40:05.670 --> 40:06.170
You can't leave.

40:12.280 --> 40:13.260
I gave you the pills.

40:13.710 --> 40:14.460
What else do you want?

40:15.440 --> 40:17.740
Your pills...

40:17.760 --> 40:18.340
You overpaid.

40:19.590 --> 40:20.010
Yes.

40:20.230 --> 40:20.650
Yes.

40:21.440 --> 40:22.780
You can have the Longevity Art book.

40:24.480 --> 40:25.690
This mega mystic pouch

40:25.840 --> 40:27.170
is a gift for you as well.

40:31.030 --> 40:31.690
It's a gift.

40:37.030 --> 40:37.780
The Five Mengs

40:38.150 --> 40:39.740
are righteous!

40:42.070 --> 40:42.820
Indeed.

40:43.030 --> 40:43.610
Indeed.

40:43.800 --> 40:44.260
Farewell.

40:46.920 --> 40:47.650
No need to see me off!

40:47.880 --> 40:48.300
No need!

40:54.840 --> 40:55.740
The pills

40:56.110 --> 40:57.210
are more useful than gems.

40:58.030 --> 40:59.340
Lucky for me, I brought extra when I left

40:59.360 --> 41:00.210
Shenshou Valley.

41:01.630 --> 41:02.210
And now,

41:02.710 --> 41:04.010
I also have a mystic pouch.

41:04.710 --> 41:06.570
I no longer have to bring many bags with me.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.780
For your fragment of a magic item,

41:10.880 --> 41:12.010
I'll buy it for five low-grade gems.

41:12.280 --> 41:12.900
What do you think?

41:13.400 --> 41:13.860
No.

41:14.480 --> 41:15.380
[Han Yunzhi]
It is nonetheless

41:15.510 --> 41:17.210
a fragment from a Core Formation Stage cultivator's magic item.

41:17.670 --> 41:18.820
You keep promoting it.

41:18.920 --> 41:20.090
What can it do

41:20.230 --> 41:21.010
exactly?

41:22.280 --> 41:22.940
It's very useful.

41:24.920 --> 41:25.380
Look.

41:26.880 --> 41:27.210
I...

41:28.590 --> 41:29.900
I can use that fragment

41:30.400 --> 41:31.860
to hide the Green Vial.

41:36.400 --> 41:37.740
It is a fragment of a magic item, all right.

41:38.150 --> 41:39.170
But it's

41:39.350 --> 41:40.260
[Lu Mingyuan]
too small.

41:40.880 --> 41:41.460
You know what?

41:42.070 --> 41:43.900
Given you also have a cute face,

41:44.150 --> 41:44.940
I will offer

41:45.440 --> 41:46.650
one strengthening pill.

41:48.280 --> 41:48.860
Mister Lu,

41:49.360 --> 41:50.570
[Chen Qiaoqian, Chen Rong]
you're taking advantage of her.

41:51.070 --> 41:52.010
I offer six gems.

41:52.400 --> 41:53.170
Can I have it?

41:53.590 --> 41:54.300
I offer seven gems.

41:55.550 --> 41:56.210
Eight gems.

41:56.710 --> 41:57.130
Okay.

41:57.320 --> 41:58.250
Eight gems, it is.

42:01.590 --> 42:02.130
Sorry.

42:02.760 --> 42:03.740
I was just joking around.

42:03.920 --> 42:05.300
[Chen Mu]
Me too.

42:06.150 --> 42:06.940
Besides, Miss.

42:07.030 --> 42:07.860
Your fragment

42:08.030 --> 42:09.130
truly isn't worth that much.

42:19.000 --> 42:19.460
Miss.

42:19.880 --> 42:20.650
Don't go.

42:21.280 --> 42:22.570
They don't want it, but I do.

42:23.190 --> 42:23.610
One gem.

42:24.280 --> 42:25.490
I offer one gem.

42:25.960 --> 42:27.420
I'm asking for seven gems.

42:28.030 --> 42:28.650
All of you...

42:29.000 --> 42:30.380
Is anyone else interested?

42:34.670 --> 42:36.690
I don't think anyone else is bidding.

42:37.360 --> 42:37.980
Anyone?

42:39.880 --> 42:40.820
Two vials of Golden Marrow Pill

42:41.510 --> 42:42.530
for your fragment of a magic item, please.

42:43.590 --> 42:44.940
Please don't tell me you're joking around too.

42:59.030 --> 42:59.530
Deal.

43:10.920 --> 43:11.530
My friend,

43:12.070 --> 43:12.820
why are you doing this?

43:13.360 --> 43:14.980
You ruined my negotiation for no reason at all.

43:15.400 --> 43:16.170
You think you can leave?

43:19.710 --> 43:20.300
But

43:20.960 --> 43:22.210
I bought this fragment

43:22.590 --> 43:23.780
with a fair price.

43:24.030 --> 43:25.570
Isn't this a fair trade?

43:25.920 --> 43:26.530
Fine.

43:26.960 --> 43:28.130
Let me teach you

43:28.440 --> 43:29.820
what fairness means.

43:47.340 --> 43:52.660
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:53.900 --> 43:59.300
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:59.420 --> 44:02.620
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

44:02.860 --> 44:05.100
♪Old scenes rise again♪

44:05.500 --> 44:08.340
♪Too hard to forget♪

44:08.860 --> 44:12.820
♪Easier just to miss♪

44:13.660 --> 44:19.140
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

44:20.300 --> 44:25.580
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

44:26.180 --> 44:29.220
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

44:29.500 --> 44:31.620
♪Swept away by time♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.900
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:35.380 --> 44:39.340
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:39.820 --> 44:42.660
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:42.940 --> 44:44.860
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:45.300 --> 44:47.740
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:48.060 --> 44:51.580
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:52.140 --> 44:55.100
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:55.420 --> 44:58.340
♪Time lost its name♪

44:58.740 --> 45:01.580
♪Was it yesterday♪

45:01.980 --> 45:05.540
♪Or tomorrow?♪

45:05.900 --> 45:08.740
♪The world has changed♪

45:09.140 --> 45:10.980
♪Beyond recall♪

45:11.540 --> 45:13.260
♪Time will fade♪

45:13.660 --> 45:18.460
♪All the words ever spoken♪

45:19.140 --> 45:22.020
♪Only this longing remains♪

45:22.500 --> 45:27.780
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

45:28.900 --> 45:35.540
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

45:36.020 --> 45:45.740
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
